Changelog for s6-frontend.

In 0.2.0.0
----------

 - Bugfixes.
 - Syntax improvements for s6 apply, s6 set *, s6 live install
 - Better s6 --user management, with /etc/s6-user.conf and
XDG variable support
 - Committed sets now hold the catch-all logger fifo.
 - Committed sets are snapshotted for transparent upgrades.
(Store changes still break the feature, but it's better than
nothing. More robustness is planned for the future.)


In 0.1.0.0
----------

 - Bugfixes.
 - Documentation updates.
 - New option: s6 -u|--user, for user services.
 - New commands: s6 live reset, s6 apply.
 - New shortcuts: s6 enable,disable,start,stop,kill,apply.
 - The fdholder user is now a configuration variable.
 - New option for s6 live stop: -c|--clean


In 0.0.1.2
----------

 - Documentation updates.
 - Adaptation to skalibs-2.15.0.0.
 - Support for disabling RPATH at configure time.


In 0.0.1.1
----------

 - Bugfixes.


In 0.0.1.0
----------

 - Initial release.
